  "notes": [
    "Special Express overnight sleeper service. It runs from Bangkok (Krung Thep Aphiwat) to Padang Besar. This train provides air-conditioned second-class sleepers and is popular for travelers heading to the Malaysian border. Advance booking is highly recommended as there are only two sleeper carriages. At Hat Yai Junction, they will add a couple of 3rd Class carriages for people to cross the border. Tickets for these carriages cost 50 baht and can only be bought at the station."
